# Force LF on all text files. The setup machine is Windows; without this,
# git would check out CRLF and files that run inside Linux containers (the
# Dockerfile, compose, yaml, python, the built SPA) would break with
# confusing "\r" errors.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
